      "reason": "WP7: T&C: 5% back as NeuCoins (Non-EMI) on partner Tata Brands \"as defined in Annex 1\", governed by the Annex 1 fair-usage policy. mcc_exclude restates Annex 1's non-accruing rental/government MCC transactions and keeps this rule v2-only, so the old feed (which has no UPI carve-out) never pays the partner rate on UPI. D29b: priority 11 outranks the capped insurance/grocery/utility/telecom rules (14-17), so a partner spend in a capped category (BigBasket groceries, Tata Play at MCC 4899) earns the partner rate; the UPI (9) and merchant-EMI (10) carve-outs still outrank it.",
